    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/88d51e902e4029ecb3ad4ffafb57c7d3.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Frontier is a fresh look on Real Time Strategy genre. Plants vs Zombies marries Age of War with Brotato progression system. It blends multiple genres into a hot mix of tactics, strategy and roguelike action to create unique player experience with endless replayability. The game features campaign with multiple endings along with battle mode. Welcome back, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.poster.avif?t=1754767269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.webm?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.mp4?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/7ad6f07463689d0f1f641e574b7d12d5.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy armada is closing on your position from both sides. Establish a base and use all means to protect it. Commander, this is your last Iron Frontier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/8a6b13428d1510906ea65e478abb6e13.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.poster.avif?t=1754767269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.webm?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.mp4?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your army from dozens of units and buildings. Command your troops to hit the enemy where it hurts. Use airstrikes and other abilities to rain death on the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/9821be707255559bbc9b0307ca33fd39.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your troops with hundreds of upgrades and power ups. Unlock new units, technologies and permanent upgrades to turn your army into a killing machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/f854572ad14a4386760def2c757751fd.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Annihilate enemy forces with cunning tactics and extreme firepower. Create insane builds to turn the battleground into a kill zone! No prisoners, no survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you on the battlefield!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/88d51e902e4029ecb3ad4ffafb57c7d3.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Frontier is a fresh look on Real Time Strategy genre. Plants vs Zombies marries Age of War with Brotato progression system. It blends multiple genres into a hot mix of tactics, strategy and roguelike action to create unique player experience with endless replayability. The game features campaign with multiple endings along with battle mode. Welcome back, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.poster.avif?t=1754767269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.webm?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/d80b438e1f895277db80b6c010581385.mp4?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/7ad6f07463689d0f1f641e574b7d12d5.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy armada is closing on your position from both sides. Establish a base and use all means to protect it. Commander, this is your last Iron Frontier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/8a6b13428d1510906ea65e478abb6e13.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.poster.avif?t=1754767269\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.webm?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/b0b77eaf1badad7a3172b7a8832b0b4c.mp4?t=1754767269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your army from dozens of units and buildings. Command your troops to hit the enemy where it hurts. Use airstrikes and other abilities to rain death on the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/9821be707255559bbc9b0307ca33fd39.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your troops with hundreds of upgrades and power ups. Unlock new units, technologies and permanent upgrades to turn your army into a killing machine!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131290/extras/f854572ad14a4386760def2c757751fd.avif?t=1754767269\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Annihilate enemy forces with cunning tactics and extreme firepower. Create insane builds to turn the battleground into a kill zone! No prisoners, no survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you on the battlefield!</p>",
    "short_description": "Roguelike card strategy game. Plants vs Zombies marries Age of War with Brotato progression system. Create your army from hundreds of units, buildings and upgrades. Annihilate the enemy with cunning tactics and extreme firepower! Create insane builds to turn the battlefield into a kill zone!",
